---
description: >-
  Hour-resolution scheduling using tickInterval 6hour with a
  "%d %H:%M" axis format, verifying multi-hour tick spacing across day
  boundaries.
---
gantt
  title A Gantt Diagram
  dateFormat   YYYY-MM-DD
  axisFormat   %d %H:%M
  tickInterval 6hour
  excludes     weekends

  section Section
  A task           : a1, 2022-10-03, 1d
  Another task     : after a1, 2d
  section Another
  Task in sec      : 2022-10-04, 2d
  another task     : 2d
